INCOME	salary	300000
EXPENSE	fee	300
EXPENSE	food	3300
EXPENSE	rent	80000
TOTAL-INCOME	300000
TOTAL-EXPENSE	83600
SCHEDULED	80000
ORDINARY	3600
NET	216400
MEASURE	usd
EXPENSE	food	450
TOTAL-INCOME	0
TOTAL-EXPENSE	450
SCHEDULED	0
ORDINARY	450
NET	-450
UNRESOLVED	2027-01-15	mystery	jpy	200
ENDINCOME-EXPENSE
